00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:53.549
What just happened?

00:10:53.549 --> 00:10:54.549
Nothing.

00:10:54.549 --> 00:11:09.549
Okay, Alexander is now Connor?

00:11:09.549 --> 00:11:13.549
Okay, well, I guess if Puff Daddy can become ditty

00:11:13.549 --> 00:11:15.549
and Prince can say he's that squiggly thing,

00:11:15.549 --> 00:11:17.549
but I'm worried about what's underneath.

00:11:17.549 --> 00:11:19.549
Clark, memorywiper, not this kid tried to kill you.

00:11:19.549 --> 00:11:22.549
Look, his name is not the only thing that changed.

00:11:22.549 --> 00:11:25.889
Connor has.

00:11:25.889 --> 00:11:27.889
He's only half Lex, it turns out.

00:11:27.889 --> 00:11:28.889
What?

00:11:28.889 --> 00:11:30.889
Okay, well, if you say the other half is Tess,

00:11:30.889 --> 00:11:32.889
I'm gonna officially write that family off for good.

00:11:32.889 --> 00:11:34.889
Lois, the other half is me.

00:11:34.889 --> 00:11:40.759
Are you trying to tell me

00:11:40.759 --> 00:11:45.759
