00:11:52.639 --> 00:12:00.159
I can honestly say I have no idea how I'm supposed to be feeling about this.

00:12:00.159 --> 00:12:02.159
Lois, all that matters is that we have a kid in the bar,

00:12:02.159 --> 00:12:03.159
