00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:33.200
We thought we destroyed it, but Lex must have kept a sample.

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:39.009
After he engineered Alexander, he thought that my DNA would stop the extent

00:12:39.009 --> 00:12:43.009
DNA would stop the accelerated mitosis, and it worked.

00:12:43.009 --> 00:12:47.009
Lois, because of me, this kid has no chance of having a normal life.

00:12:47.009 --> 00:12:49.009
No, hold on, Chicken Little.

00:12:49.009 --> 00:12:52.009
How do we know that Connor wouldn't love to be the only kid on the block

00:12:52.009 --> 00:12:54.009
