00:12:54.009 --> 00:12:57.059
What?

00:12:57.059 --> 00:13:03.559
Sometimes I forget that you never saw what it was like.

00:13:03.559 --> 00:13:08.559
Growing up, being different, feeling like an outsider, like a freak.

00:13:08.559 --> 00:13:12.279
Like you were all alone.

00:13:12.279 --> 00:13:14.279
