00:13:15.279 --> 00:13:16.279
Most, you don't understand.

00:13:16.279 --> 00:13:18.279
It never goes away.

00:13:18.279 --> 00:13:23.289
It's always in there.

00:13:23.289 --> 00:13:27.830
The only thing that's ever made me feel normal is you.

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:38.879
Connor is not alone.

00:13:38.879 --> 00:13:41.840
He has us.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:14:04.220
