00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:07.220
I feel like I stepped into a Tom Clancy now.

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:11.220
I know you're probably still reeling from the Connor bomb that I dropped on you this morning,

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:15.220
