00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:25.220
I know you already went up this hill and got shot down.

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:27.220
Since the Lionel Clark knew came around in the end,

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:30.220
Clark is hoping this Luther will change his spots too.

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:33.220
Hey, we need to draw a line in the sand.

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.220
Lois, Clark needs to act now.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:38.220
Lionel knows his secret.

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:41.220
He knows what can hurt him, and if they rumble in the asphalt jungle,

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:43.220
Clark could go down for the count.

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:45.220
Yeah, he could.

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:49.220
But we both know how Lionel destroyed his own world

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:50.220
when he had a super-powered son, and if he gets a super-powered son,

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:53.220
powered son, and if he gets a hold of Connor, he will do the same here.

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:56.220
I know how dangerous this is for Clark.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:59.759
We don't have a choice.

00:14:59.759 --> 00:15:05.759
Maybe we do.

00:15:05.759 --> 00:15:06.759
Just hear me out.

00:15:06.759 --> 00:15:09.759
When Elliot Ness couldn't Nab Capone for murder,

00:15:09.759 --> 00:15:12.759
the government sent him up the river for getting sloppy with his taxes.

00:15:12.759 --> 00:15:15.759
Now, you and I both know that Lionel would have spent a pretty penny

00:15:15.759 --> 00:15:17.759
to hide the fact that he's from another world.

00:15:17.759 --> 00:15:19.759
What if he was just as sloppy?

00:15:19.759 --> 00:15:21.759
If we found a detail that he overlooked,

00:15:21.759 --> 00:15:23.759
