00:15:23.759 --> 00:15:37.039
And his entire house of cards will come crashing down.

00:15:37.039 --> 00:15:40.039
The permitted remains came from one of the other clones.

00:15:40.039 --> 00:15:43.039
So, my boy is alive.

00:15:43.039 --> 00:15:45.039
We've got to find him.

00:15:45.039 --> 00:15:49.039
We convinced Dr. LaMelle to tell us that Mercer took him to small help.

00:15:49.039 --> 00:15:51.039
He's with Clark Kent.

00:15:51.039 --> 00:15:53.039
Not for long.

00:15:53.039 --> 00:15:59.039
It is time for my prodigal son to return.

00:15:59.039 --> 00:16:00.039
Here.

00:16:00.039 --> 00:16:17.110
This is pointless.

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:18.110
Everything that we do with our ability.

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:19.110
