Lefted the tractor without any practice?

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:30.110
When you put it down, you broke the beam behind the stall.

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:33.110
Who taught you how to do all this stuff?

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:36.110
My parents were there every step of the way.

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:42.110
My dad, he believed that all the hard work he had me do.

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:45.110
You teach me how to control my abilities.

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:46.110
Teach me character.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:55.210
Connor, you may not have parents, but you have me.

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:58.840
