00:17:55.079 --> 00:18:03.589
Unfortunately, uh, Clark, I just talked to my inside man,

00:18:03.589 --> 00:18:04.589
and Lionel knows that.

00:18:04.589 --> 00:18:05.589
that Connor's here.

00:18:05.589 --> 00:18:07.589
So we need to move him.

00:18:07.589 --> 00:18:09.589
I'm gonna call Oliver and Chloe in Star City.

00:18:09.589 --> 00:18:10.589
We can send him there.

00:18:10.589 --> 00:18:12.589
We have kept him in the dark about who he really is.

00:18:12.589 --> 00:18:14.589
Don't you think it's time to let Connor know the truth

